hing"}, {"beat": 228, "text": "But sometimes I'm scared, I'm paralyzed"}, {"beat": 236, "text": "But I will find the strength to reinvent myself"}, {"beat": 244, "text": "[outro]"}, {"beat": 252, "text": ""}]}}}